  designNotes: Target creature copies every status of the creature facing it, good
    and harmful, with the Days they have left; that one keeps its own. Like Mimetic
    Theory, it works between the creature it's dropped on and the one facing it,
    so there's one target to pick (the user, 2026-10-15).
  artDescription: 'A woman in front of a tall mirror, her reflection wearing a different
    man''s bandages, halo and storm cloud: in the room he stands beside her with
    exactly those, and now she has them too.'
